# Legacy cookbook corpus: cookbook/devtools/008_log_timestamp

## Case: legacy-cookbook-devtools-008-log-timestamp
id: "legacy.cookbook.devtools.008_log_timestamp"
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "log_timestamp.at"
```auto
dep env_logger
dep chrono
dep log
use.rs log::info
use.rs chrono::Local
use.rs env_logger::Builder

fn main() {
    var builder = Builder.new()
    builder.format((buf, record) => {
        buf.writeln(f"[${Local.now().format("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S")}] ${record.level()} - ${record.args()}")
    })
    builder.init()
    info("application started")
    info("with timestamp logging")
    assert(true)
}
```

